<title>ESTONIA: KALEV TO PAY DIVIDENDS ON JULY 18.</title>
<headline>KALEV TO PAY DIVIDENDS ON JULY 18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian confectionary producer Kalev said on Thursday it will pay dividends from its 1996 profit on July 18.</p>
<p>The shareholders to receive dividends will be fixed on July 11, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Kalev shareholders will discuss the proposal on Friday to pay dividends of 22 kroons per share or 7.5 million kroons out of the total 1996 profit of 14.8 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
